  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to develop Health Insurance Information System (IS) platform for the Ethiopian Health Insurance Agency (EHIA), Addis Ababa, Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the contract is to provide Technical Assistance (TA) support to Ethiopian health insurance agency (EHIA) in the implementation of Health insurance information system for both the social health insurance (SHI) and community-based Health insurance (CBHI) programs Specifically, the technical assistance is expected to:- Enhance efficiency and reliability in members enrolment and claim processing of health insurance - Enhance efficiency in information use and exchange across multiple entities to be involved in health insurance system and beyond.- Build capacity of EHIA, CBHI scheme and health facility (HF) staff in handling and sustaining the ICT system.  - Develop a prototype system for SHI registration, premium collection and claim management</narrative>
  </description>
